<title>USA: Rollins Inc buys back 433,000 shrs in Q2.</title>
<headline>Rollins Inc buys back 433,000 shrs in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rollins Inc said Wednesday it repurchased 433,300 shares of its $1 par value common stock during its second quarter ended June 30.</p>
<p>Rollins owns and operates Orkin Exterminating Co Inc, which offers termite and pest control services, and also provides lawn care and plantscaping services.</p>
<p>It also owns and operates Rollins Protective Services, an electronic security systems company.</p>
</text>
